!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Tumor tissue was lysed in TRIzol reagent with RNA isolated following manufacturers instructions.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA-seq libraries were prepared using theNEBNext Ultra RNA Library Prep Kit for Illumina (catalog E7530L). Briefly, 500 ng total RNA was used to isolate mRNA with the NEB Next Oligo dT Magnetic Isolation Module (catalog E7490L). The isolated mRNA undergoes fragmentation, priming, cDNA synthesis and end repair/dA-tail. Individual index primers for multiplexing were added during PCR library enrichment after adaptor ligation.
!Sample_data_processing = Image analysis and base calling were performed using Illumina's Real Time Analysis v1.18 software, followed by 'demultiplexing' of indexed reads and generation of FASTQ files, using Illumina's bcl2fastq v1.8.4
!Sample_data_processing = Reads of low quality as well as those with better alignment to mm9 were omitted prior to alignment to hg19 using TopHat v2.0.12. Counts were generated from Tophat alignments at the gene-level employing the "intersection-strict" overlap mode in HTSeq v0.6.1.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: hg19
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: tab-delimited text files include counts genreated by HTSeq count
